      "evidence": "Whole1dc goal/P teaches entity-specific amount before concentration methods:0.20molO2 and0.20molHe have equal counts of named entities, but0.40molO atoms in oxygen; equal amount does not imply equal mass. Fresh0.30molNaCl formula units give0.30molNa+ and0.30molCl-,0.60mol total ions, not NaCl molecules. Molecule/atom/ion/formula-unit distinctions are actually assessed. All current ordinary predecessor nodes in these eight views remain authored targets after the addition; no circular formula-only route or practice substitution is introduced."
